# Why is it so cheap?

The market is pricing the following concerns:
1. North American markets have seen a peak in growth and are likely to contract continuously
2. Tariffs will compress profit margins (most products are produced in Asian plants)
3. The controversy over the founder ' s proxy created uncertainty about governance
4. The appointment of the new CEO (formerly Nike executive Heidi O'Neill) was "no confidence vote" cast by the market
5. Stock prices fell by 38 per cent in 2026

